h paired Aces, they likely have an Ace for trips, a King for two pair, or a pocket pair. I'm essentially only beating a bluff, and calling 1,189 chips (about 6% of my stack) with such a marginal hand on the river is -EV. Folding preserves my chip lead.\n\nAnswer: -1"}
